{% extends "quarterly_deep_dive/llm_prompts/base_prompt.j2" %}

{# Specific context for the main narrative of Section 8 (User Interaction) #}
{# NOTE: Correcting the likely error in REPORT_STRUCTURE which might have listed section3_narrative.j2 #}
{% set output_format_description = "a coherent narrative paragraph summarizing the analysis of user interaction requirements, suitable for the main body text. Use Markdown for clarity (e.g., simple bolding) if helpful." %}

{% block task_instructions %}
Synthesize the provided chart insight, callout, and data summary for "{{ section_title }}" into a flowing narrative text focused specifically on the trend of vulnerabilities requiring user interaction.
Your narrative should describe the pattern observed during the reporting period regarding the proportion of CVEs needing user interaction versus those exploitable directly. Discuss the implications of this trend for overall risk and potential defense strategies.
Integrate the key point highlighted in the callout. Aim for 3-5 sentences. You may use simple Markdown (like **bold**) for emphasis if appropriate.
{% endblock task_instructions %}

{% block data_context %}
Section Key: {{ data_context_payload.section_key | default('section_8_user_interaction_deep_dive') }}

Chart Insights Generated for this Section:
{% for chart_id, insight in data_context_payload.chart_insights_in_section.items() %}
- Insight ({{ chart_id }}): {{ insight }}
{% else %}
- No specific chart insights provided.
{% endfor %}

Callouts Generated for this Section:
{% for callout_key, callout_text in data_context_payload.callouts_in_section.items() %}
- {{ callout_key | replace("_", " ") | title }}: {{ callout_text }}
{% else %}
- No callouts generated for this section.
{% endfor %}

Data Summaries for Charts in this Section:
{% for chart_id, summary in data_context_payload.charts_data_summaries_in_section.items() %}
